### Запуск Python-кода
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/student/tasks/1/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeworkItemId": 1,
  "sourceCode": "print('Hello from sandbox')"
}

### Успешное выполнение Python
POST http://localhost:8090/internal/v1/executions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "executionId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "language": "PYTHON",
  "sourceCode": "a = input()\nb = input()\nprint(a + b)",
  "timeLimitMs": 2000,
  "memoryLimitMb": 128,
  "outputLimitBytes": 8192,
  "testCases": [
    {
      "id": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "inputText": "Hello\nWorld\n",
      "expectedOutput": "HelloWorld",
      "comparisonMode": "NORMALIZED"
    }
  ]
}
